From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: office <office@localhost>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] wordcraft: rustfmt the files the patch queue touches
 (mechanical formatting, regenerate on every sync)

rustfmt --edition 2024 over every .rs file touched by the queue, so cargo fmt --all --check is clean in CI lint. No behaviour change.
Always the last patch of the queue: scripts/sync-upstream.sh regenerates it (--fmt, or implied when the queue has one), never rebases it.
---
